    "text": "By WBRC Digital Staff ,\n7 hours ago\nHUEYTOWN, Ala. (WBRC) - Two people were airlifted two a hospital after a crash in Hueytown Thursday, police said. According to Hueytown Police, a garbage truck and car were involved in a wreck on John’s Road near a water treatment facility. Police said four people were in the car...\nRead full article",
